      "created_at": "2025-05-12T19:18:49.136Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am having a problem configuring my the POS. With respect to the photo, these are some problems im getting:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>I have an item “Automobile lying board”, it’s in an Item Group “Automobile Tools”. When I search the product in the textbox “Search by item code…”, i cannot find it, I can find it only when I select the right Item group. I want to be able to write search a product independently of the item group.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I want to be able to enter the discount as an amount not as a percentage.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/c/dcc4e490912658e088a43750803d34b71b5f4010.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/dcc4e490912658e088a43750803d34b71b5f4010\" title=\"final\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/c/dcc4e490912658e088a43750803d34b71b5f4010_2_553x500.png\" alt=\"final\" data-base62-sha1=\"vv0SPNEELnsuelS1gL05nxNHa8w\" width=\"553\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/c/dcc4e490912658e088a43750803d34b71b5f4010_2_553x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/c/dcc4e490912658e088a43750803d34b71b5f4010_2_829x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/c/dcc4e490912658e088a43750803d34b71b5f4010.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFCFD\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">final</span><span class=\"informations\">896×810 30.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
