      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mohammad_noorani_bak\">@Mohammad_Noorani_Bak</a> - I achieved discount by amount by some configurations, instead of any customisation.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/e/7ecf644b145462d07899ef3945deb81653ed5023.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7ecf644b145462d07899ef3945deb81653ed5023\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-01-03 at 3.41.35 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/e/7ecf644b145462d07899ef3945deb81653ed5023_2_690x344.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-03 at 3.41.35 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"i5OuKZxuMYEwBoUQhkvwK8BXQhZ\" width=\"690\" height=\"344\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/e/7ecf644b145462d07899ef3945deb81653ed5023_2_690x344.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/e/7ecf644b145462d07899ef3945deb81653ed5023_2_1035x516.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/e/7ecf644b145462d07899ef3945deb81653ed5023_2_1380x688.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3F5F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2026-01-03 at 3.41.35 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">2650×1322 183 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Just added the additional discount amount field in the POS Settings Doctype.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/d/cd0492d4cb5ed37a55a7fa422fbefd57c56f19cf.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/cd0492d4cb5ed37a55a7fa422fbefd57c56f19cf\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-01-03 at 3.42.14 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/u